WOW-BG3 vmangos patch 0026: hold by guid, for exactly the creatures BG3's turn-based mode froze.

BG3 decides per character which ones its turn-based mode takes in (measured in BG3: the IsInFTB tag and
time factor 0, up to about 40 m but not by distance alone), so the radius hold of 0010 held creatures BG3 left
free. Now:

- `hold HID guids G1,G2,...` holds those creatures (on the sender's map) under HID, the same hold as the radius
  form (hidden stun, renewed by every `hold HID`, let go by `unhold HID`, logout or an hour without a
  renewal); already held ones stay. Reply: `WOWBG3 hold HID ok NEW TOTAL SKIPPED GONE` (GONE: not on the map).
- `hold HID drop G1,G2,...` lets those go again unless a fight or another of the player's holds has them.
  Reply: `WOWBG3 hold HID dropped N` or `unknown`.
- The radius form is unchanged; both share HoldCreatures. A line takes as many guids as fit in 255 characters.
